# c4c5-infeasible — the decision table (family contract in fixture.yaml; per-row intent below).
# id           | world  | patch | env          | expect
# parks         = the verdict leg: a REAL marker parks + audits #66, #70 beside it keeps its unit
# probe-fail    = the same inert world, but STUB_GH=fail: the probe is ATTEMPTED (CALL line), NO
#                 write, PROBE_FAILED reported, #66 keeps today's behaviour completely
# quoted-inert  = the inert world read normally: the quoted marker latches NOTHING, the
#                 human-blocked #71 is not even read — both keep today's behaviour
parks         | verdict |       |                | parks
probe-fail    | inert   |       | STUB_GH=fail   | probe-fail
quoted-inert  | inert   |       |                | quoted-inert
